            </note>
            <note corresp="#d250-f2" n="2" xml:id="d250-f2-content">
                <p>The U.S. Delegation had received preliminary clearance from the Department for
                    the substance of this draft, on October 31 (Deptel Gadel 82, October 31, 7 p.
                    m., 320/10–3150).</p>
            </note>
